<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1c1e28"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I hope this email finds you well. I wanted to reach out and congratulate you on your upcoming transition to agency owner.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1c1e28"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I look forward to discussing how we can support you in this new role and ensure a smooth transition. Please let me know your availability so we can schedule a meeting at your convenience.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1c1e28"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Congratulations once again, and I am excited to see the great things you will accomplish in your new position.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.875"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1c1e28"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Best regards,<br />
